  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel treats lightning path as a named cultivation path with mortal flying experts, Immortal dao marks, and specialized resource pools, not as a generic word for electricity.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dong Po Kuang, known as Flying Lightning, is named one of the few flying masters of northern plains and a lightning path Gu Master with rank four upper stage cultivation. In battle he cracks lightning around himself that destroys defensive Gu, kills or wounds blockers, and forms a battle spear of lightning.",
      "chapters": [
        512
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_po_kong",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_defensive_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vicious Lightning Fiend releases three lightning figures from his immortal aperture that are lightning deities containing lightning path dao marks, strong enough that even as a rank six Gu Immortal he challenges and pressures rank seven opponents.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lightning-deities",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_vicious_lightning_fiend",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When lightning accumulates to a degree it becomes liquid lightning water, converting destructive force into water of vitality that can draw out potential. Lightning path Gu Immortals often build lightning pools to store that lightning water and use the pools to nurture large numbers of lightning path mortal Gu. A lightning pool’s significance to lightning path Gu Immortals is compared to Five Light Mountain for light path Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lightning-pools",
